context:
DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/service_tokens/{service_token_id}
Deletes a service token.
Required: service_token_id (path); account_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/service_tokens/{service_token_id}
Fetches a single service token.
Required: service_token_id (path); account_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/access/service_tokens/{service_token_id}
Updates a configured service token.
Required: service_token_id (path); account_id (path); body (body)
